---
const title = "Phocion — AI Data Security Gateway";
const description =
  "Phocion is a model-agnostic AI data-security gateway: real-time PII/PHI masking and semantic injection screening, self-hosted in your VPC.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="wrap header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="wordmark" aria-label="Phocion home">
          <img class="mark" src="/phocion_logo_440x440.png" width="40" height="40" alt="" />
          <span class="wordmark-text">PHO<span class="cio">CIO</span>N</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap">
          <p class="eyebrow">AI Data Security Gateway</p>
          <h1>Every prompt, screened before it leaves your network. Every response, screened before it touches your infrastructure.</h1>
          <p class="lede">
            Introducing Phocion. A model-agnostic proxy that sits between your
            applications and any LLM provider — masking sensitive data in real
            time and screening for prompt injection, without changing how your
            team calls the model.
          </p>
          <div class="status-badge">
            <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            In active development, running technical pilots
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="problem">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2>The problem</h2>
          <p>
            Teams are wiring LLMs directly into products and internal tools faster
            than their data-governance policies can keep up. Customer PII, PHI, and
            proprietary business data routinely end up in prompts sent to
            third-party model providers — with no consistent layer checking what
            goes out, or what comes back.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="how">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2>How it works</h2>
          <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>Drop-in proxy</h3>
              <p>Model-agnostic — sits in front of whichever LLM provider you already use, no application rewrite required.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>Real-time masking</h3>
              <p>PII and PHI are detected and masked in-flight, before a request reaches the model.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>Injection screening</h3>
              <p>Every request is semantically screened for prompt-injection attempts before it reaches the model.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <h3>Self-hosted / VPC</h3>
              <p>Runs inside your own infrastructure — sensitive traffic never has to leave your network boundary.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="credibility">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2>What's real, right now</h2>
          <div class="metrics">
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value qualitative">Low-latency</span>
              <span class="metric-label">Gateway overhead by design — no benchmarked figure published yet</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="notes">
            <li>Runs as an inline proxy alongside your existing infrastructure, not a round-trip to a third-party scanning service.</li>
            <li>Designed to <strong>reduce token overhead</strong> via <strong>semantic caching</strong> — savings are directional, not yet a measured, published figure.</li>
            <li>Built with SOC2/HIPAA-oriented controls in mind. Phocion is not currently SOC2 certified.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="honest-status">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h2>Status</h2>
          <p>
            Phocion is in active development, running technical pilots. This page
            exists so the claims made about it elsewhere have something real to
            point to.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="wordmark-text small">PHO<span class="cio">CIO</span>N</span>
        <span class="footer-meta">
          <span class="copyright">&copy; 2026 SRF Development, Inc., maker of Phocion.</span>
          <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:info@phocion.ai">info@phocion.ai</a>
        </span>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --color-primary: #040f49;
        --color-primary-deep: #030a33;
        --color-secondary: #c3cee3;
        --color-secondary-muted: #8b98b8;
        --color-accent: #00e8ff;
        --color-card: #0a1a5e;
        --color-border: rgba(195, 206, 227, 0.18);

        --font-head: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
        --font-body: "Inter", sans-serif;
        --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        background: var(--color-primary);
        color: var(--color-secondary);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        color: #f4f7fc;
        margin: 0 0 0.6em;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      p {
        margin: 0 0 1em;
      }

      .wrap {
        max-width: 1140px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.5rem;
      }

      .site-header {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      }

      .header-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
        padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .wordmark {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .wordmark-text {
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        color: #f4f7fc;
      }

      .wordmark-text.small {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .cio {
        color: var(--color-accent);
      }

      .eyebrow {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        color: var(--color-accent);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 6rem 0 5rem;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        max-width: 34ch;
      }

      .lede {
        max-width: 58ch;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        color: var(--color-secondary);
      }

      .status-badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--color-secondary);
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
      }

      .dot {
        width: 9px;
        height: 9px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--color-accent);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--color-accent);
      }

      section {
        padding: 4.5rem 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      }

      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }

      .card {
        background: var(--color-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 1.75rem;
      }

      .card h3 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      }

      .card p {
        color: var(--color-secondary-muted);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .metrics {
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }

      .metric {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.35rem;
      }

      .metric-value {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        color: var(--color-accent);
      }

      .metric-value.qualitative {
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }

      .metric-unit {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        margin-left: 0.15rem;
      }

      .metric-label {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--color-secondary-muted);
      }

      .notes {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.65rem;
      }

      .notes li {
        color: var(--color-secondary-muted);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
        position: relative;
      }

      .notes li::before {
        content: "—";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: var(--color-secondary-muted);
      }

      .site-footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        padding: 2rem 0;
      }

      .site-footer .wrap {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
      }

      .footer-meta {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .copyright {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-secondary-muted);
      }

      .contact-email {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-secondary-muted);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      }

      .contact-email:hover {
        color: var(--color-accent);
        border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent);
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
